{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "没校验的账户",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 64.02,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 2 月，Wormhole 跨链桥在 Solana 一侧，被铸出约 12 万枚 wETH。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 2 月，Wormhole 跨链桥在 Solana 一侧，被铸出约 12 万枚 wETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 8.56,
   "speechStart": 1.703,
   "speechEnd": 9.952
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "按事发时的价格，约 3.2 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "按事发时的价格，约 3.2 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 10.38,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 10.476,
   "speechEnd": 14.779
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "攻击者往程序里，传了一个伪造的系统账户。",
   "spoken": "攻击者往程序里，传了一个伪造的系统账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 15.16,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 15.255,
   "speechEnd": 18.744
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "程序读了这个账户，没有核对它是不是真的。",
   "spoken": "程序读了这个账户，没有核对它是不是真的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 19.22,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 19.316,
   "speechEnd": 22.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "守护者的签名验证，就这样被绕开。",
   "spoken": "守护者的签名验证，就这样被绕开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 23.04,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 23.04,
   "speechEnd": 25.937
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 26.38,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 26.38,
   "speechEnd": 27.21
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "在以太坊上，合约要读另一个合约，地址写在代码或存储里。",
   "spoken": "在以太坊上，合约要读另一个合约，地址写在代码或存储里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 27.64,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 27.64,
   "speechEnd": 33.215
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "在 Solana 上，程序要读的账户，由谁提供？",
   "spoken": "在 Solana 上，程序要读的账户，由谁提供？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 33.62,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 33.62,
   "speechEnd": 37.199
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "先记住这个问题。",
   "spoken": "先记住这个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 37.88,
   "dur": 1.2,
   "speechStart": 37.88,
   "speechEnd": 38.871
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "按 Kudelski 和 Halborn 的分析，问题出在一个已经弃用的读取函数。",
   "spoken": "按 Kudelski 和 Halborn 的分析，问题出在一个已经弃用的读取函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 39.3,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 39.3,
   "speechEnd": 44.651
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "它不检查传进来的系统账户，是不是真的系统账户。",
   "spoken": "它不检查传进来的系统账户，是不是真的系统账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 45.04,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 45.131,
   "speechEnd": 49.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "修复的办法，是改用带校验的函数。Jump Crypto 补足了全部 ETH。",
   "spoken": "修复的办法，是改用带较验的函数。Jump Crypto 补足了全部 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 49.5,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 49.5,
   "speechEnd": 55.513
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "同样的错误，换一条链，就换了一副样子。",
   "spoken": "同样的错误，换一条链，就换了一副样子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 55.96,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 55.96,
   "speechEnd": 59.303
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "每种链上的程序，到底在相信什么？",
   "spoken": "每种链上的程序，到底在相信什么？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-13.wav",
